2112: stage 16 no longer has the GPU draw its red, green and blue band into the boot framebuffer. UNTESTED ON A PHONE, syntax-checked only.
Why: sweeta810=16 draws rows 160..319 of 0xe3940000 on every boot, with or without sweetfb_ast_hw, and nothing clears them until the first flip, so the band sits over the boot logo. Stage 16's one-packet IB stays as the gate. The GPU also loses its write mapping of those framebuffer pages.
Apply: git apply on the current tree, then rebuild the kernel. Check: "SWEET A810: the GPU is up (sweet_a810_ready), no band (2112)" in the log. Recovery: boot the previous image.

